#- §8Almost half of the Craftadian population has mysteriously vanished as rumours of '§0The Darkness§8' spreads throughout the land. 

[§7People are advised to not panic but also to stay inside and hide§8]

§5ₑₓcᵤSₑ mₑ wHₐt? (⊙＿⊙')
