§6『••✎••』
#- §6What is this whole 'let's be the next power couple of Craftadia' act all about? Cause keep dreaming mate!

§5Cₒmₑ ₒn... tHᵢnK ₐbₒᵤt thᵢS, ᵢ cₐn't bₑ thₑ ₒnly ₒnₑ fₑₑlᵢNg lᵢkₑ wₑ ₐᵣₑ bₒth hₑᵣₑ, tₒgₑthₑᵣ, ⱼᵤSt by cₒᵢncᵢdₑncₑ...

§6Okay.. I'm thinking...
#- §6If it's not coincidental, then that means you and I are 'destined' to be at each other's throats for eternity.

§5YₑS!! ᵢ mₑₐn nₒ, nₒt lᵢKₑ tHₐt, bᵤt yₑS, lᵢkₑ 'fₐtₑ', yₒᵤ kNₒw?!

§6You sound like Fern.

§5ᵢ fₑₑl lᵢkₑ ᵢ'ᵥₑ knₒwn yₒᵤ fₒᵣₑᵥₑᵣ, ₑᵥₑn pₐSt lᵢᵥₑS...
#- §6Past life? Now you say that... this does all... feel a little... 
'deja vu'... oh no... no...

§5Sₒ yₒᵤ'll tₑₐm ᵤp 
wᵢtH mₑ ₐnd fᵢgᵤᵣₑ 
tHᵢS ₒᵤt ᵣᵢght?

         
          ᵣᵢgHt?

                  hₑllo?

